# Media ships WITH the code.
# It used to be ignored, which was right while the folder held 161MB of
# unoptimised screenshots. Compressed it is ~23MB, small enough to live in
# the repo, and that removes the whole class of problem where the site
# builds fine and every image 404s in production.

# Source artwork, not site assets. These are the full-resolution originals
